                <mxCell id="notes" value="HOW TO READ THE BALANCES&#xa;Attendance counts the classes a student attended. Payments add class allowances separately for each course.&#xa;Remaining allowance = paid allowance − attendance. A surplus in one course never offsets another course’s deficit.&#xa;Payment presets provide reusable defaults. Recorded payments keep independent amounts and allowances." style="html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=16;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
